      "research_summary": "OPEN-TRIAGE: the specific reformulation appears open. Literature status: No literature found specifically on this reformulation. Markov theorems for virtual braids exist (\"Virtual Braids\", arXiv:0407.xxxx, 2004; \"Virtual Braids and the L-Move\", arXiv:0507.xxxx, 2005; \"Markov Theorem For Free Links\", arXiv:1112.xxxx, 2011; \"A Markov's theorem for extended welded braids and links\", arXiv:1705.xxxx, 2017), but the even-strand restriction was not located.",
